  "instance_name": "gendered_sacrifice_concept",
  "label": "Concept of Gendered Sacrifice in War and Domestic Life",
  "description": "The meme implicitly references the historical and cultural narrative that during times of war, men sacrificed their lives on the battlefield while women sacrificed their time, energy, and personal freedoms to maintain the home front. This concept is used to draw a false equivalence, suggesting that women's sacrifices are less significant or different in nature than men's, when in reality, both forms of sacrifice are profound and complex.",
